- [TF-Slim Inception-ResNet-v2](https://github.com/tensorflow/models/blob/master/research/slim/nets/inception_resnet_v2.py).
- [CIFAR-10 dataset and binary-file layout](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~kriz/cifar.html).
